Sidewalks, walkways, foot bridges,
and pathways that remain open to the public shall be accessible and shall be provided with:
1. A clear path, free of obstruction, at least 5 feet (1524 mm) in width;
2. A durable walking surface capable of supporting all imposed loads and in no case shall the design live loads be less
than 150 pounds per square foot (732.3 kg/m2);
3. Mirrors at all blind corners;
